// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Cathedral Of Pain Teleporter 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2780790776" "Cathedral Of Pain Teleporter"
// LocationString :
"P3518213261" "Your Base"
// ProfessionString :
"P308712113" "Gateway to Rularuu's Cathedral of Pain"
// DescriptionString :
"P850829150" "Travel to Rularuu's Cathedral of Pain is so dangerous, it can only be undertaken through this special function of your base. For all the danger, the reward is worth it: An Item of Power that can enhance every member of your Super Group."
// HelloString :
"P2648225470" "<color Crimson><scale 1.4>The Cathedral of Pain</scale></color><br><color Goldenrod>Level Range:</color> 35-50 <br><color Goldenrod>Player Requirements:</color> Can Be Started with 1 Player<br><color Goldenrod>Recommended Players:</color> 8 or More Supergroup Members<br><color Goldenrod>Maximum Players:</color> Up to 24 Supergroup Members<br><color Goldenrod>Length:</color> 60 minutes<br><color Goldenrod>Rewards:</color> 21 Reward Merits (VIP or Reward Level 4 only) OR Penumbra of Rularuu (Level 50 Alpha VIP only) OR a Unique Temporary Power (no restrictions).<br><br><color Crimson>Other Requirements for the Trial</color><br>In order to attempt the Cathedral of Pain trial, your Supergroup base will need to have the following:<br><br>A <color Plum>Powered</color> and <color LightBlue>Controlled</color> Raid Teleporter<br>A <color Plum>Powered</color> and <color LightBlue>Controlled</color> Mission Computer or Mission Oracle.<br><br>If you are missing either of these components, you will not be able to tune the Teleporter to the Cathedral of Pain."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3607760283" "You are unable to reach the Cathedral of Pain using this gateway."
// FirstVisitString :
"P1808791455" "<color Crimson><scale 1.4>The Cathedral of Pain</scale></color><br><color Goldenrod>Level Range:</color> 35-50 required to begin the trial, 10-50 may participate<br><color Goldenrod>Player Requirements:</color> Can Be Started with 1 Player<br><color Goldenrod>Recommended Players:</color> 8 or More Supergroup Members<br><color Goldenrod>Maximum Players:</color> Up to 24 Supergroup Members<br><color Goldenrod>Length:</color> 60 minutes<br><color Goldenrod>Rewards:</color> 21 Reward Merits (VIP or Reward Level 4 only) OR Penumbra of Rularuu (Level 50 Alpha VIP only) OR a Unique Temporary Power (no restrictions).<br><br><color Crimson>Other Requirements for the Trial</color><br>In order to attempt the Cathedral of Pain trial, your Supergroup base will need to have the following:<br><br>A <color Plum>Powered</color> and <color LightBlue>Controlled</color> Raid Teleporter<br>A <color Plum>Powered</color> and <color LightBlue>Controlled</color> Mission Computer or Mission Oracle.<br><br>If you are missing either of these components, you will not be able to tune the Teleporter to the Cathedral of Pain."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2917209954" "The dimensional frequencies are not in a resonant pattern. The Cathedral of Pain is inaccessible."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2597848368" "Too many operations running at this time. Please complete other tasks before continuing."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P549410002" "You need to be at least level 35 before you can enter the portal to the Cathedral of Pain."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P856364347" ""
// DontHaveToken :
"P1858289617" "Currently, your group is missing some of the parts required to tune the Teleporter to the Cathedral of Pain. In order to attempt the Cathedral of Pain trial, your Supergroup base will need to have the following:<br><table><tr><td width=25%>A Raid Teleporter:</td><td>This must be Powered and Controlled. This is used to get your groups to the Cathedral of Pain.</td></tr><tr><td>A Mission Computer</td><td>This must be Powered and Controlled. It is used to tune the Raid Teleporter to the Cathedral of Pain.</td></tr></table><br>Equip your base with these and you will be able to access the Cathedral of Pain."
// IntroString :
"P1549356030" "Proceed if, and only if, you are ready to challenge the Cathedral of Pain."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P2865047185" "Accept"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P82510801" "You may now access the Cathdral of Pain."
